1
00:00:00,399 --> 00:00:03,279
(Sheldon:)After the nightmare
of Anything Can Happen Thursday...

2
00:00:03,444 --> 00:00:06,694
(Sheldon:)...this is Friday night
the way it was meant to be.

3
00:00:07,406 --> 00:00:09,446
(Howard:)Who's up for Sheldon-Free Saturday?

4
00:00:13,079 --> 00:00:14,119
(Penny:)Oh, hey, guys.

5
00:00:14,288 --> 00:00:16,038
Hey, Penny and Stuart.

6
00:00:16,207 --> 00:00:18,127
(Leonard:)Hey, Stuart.

7
00:00:18,751 --> 00:00:20,921
(Penny:)- Hey, guys.
- So, what are you kids up to?

8
00:00:21,087 --> 00:00:23,717
(Penny:)Stuart has a piece in an art show
that's opening tonight.

9
00:00:23,881 --> 00:00:27,091
(Leonard:)And you guys are going together. Great.

10
00:00:27,259 --> 00:00:29,429
(Stuart:)It is great. Really great.

11
00:00:29,595 --> 00:00:31,475
It's freaking awesome.

12
00:00:32,223 --> 00:00:33,933
- What are you doing?
- Friday night.

13
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,390
(Penny:)That means Chinese food
and vintage video games?

14
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,480
(Sheldon:)Vintage doesn't even begin to describe
what we have planned.

15
00:00:39,647 --> 00:00:44,147
(Sheldon:)Tonight we are playing the classic 1980
interactive text adventure, "Zork."

16
00:00:45,403 --> 00:00:47,573
(Sheldon:)It's the buggy beta version.

17
00:00:48,155 --> 00:00:49,405
Wow, "Zork."

18
00:00:49,573 --> 00:00:51,663
(Penny:)- Well, you guys have fun.
- Yeah.

19
00:00:51,826 --> 00:00:54,116
STUART: See you, guys.
- See you, Stuart.

20
00:00:54,286 --> 00:00:56,076
- Hey, Howard?
- Yes?

21
00:00:57,039 --> 00:00:59,419
(Leonard:)Take me to a bar with women.

